<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan June wholesale prices at 12.05 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan June wholesale prices at 12.05 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 12.05 percent in June year-on-year as compared with 13.83 percent in May, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
</text>
